{"id":4009,"title":{"romaji":"Entotsu Machi no Poupelle","english":"Poupelle of Chimney Town","native":"えんとつ町のプぺル"},"slug":"entotsu_machi_no_poupelle","synopsis":"The story is set in a town surrounded by a wall that stands 4,000 meters (about 2.5 miles) tall. Because the town is full of chimneys, the air is always full of smoke. No one in the town knows what the sky looks like. On one night of the town's Halloween festival, a deliveryman accidentally drops the heart he is supposed to deliver. He cannot find the heart in the smoke and gives up. The heart continues to beat where it fell in the town of chimneys. \n\r\n\n\r\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"MOVIE","season":"FALL","year":2020,"createdAt":"2023-01-25 01:51:27","updatedAt":"2023-01-25 01:51:27","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":35609},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":98776},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":13175},{"site":"ANN","externalId":22930},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":13525},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":8902},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":10778,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/dISCzJ7jqHbwki4470OvvjvgJizKXjEHDOv6qlOe.jpg"},{"id":10779,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/FsA5ETJn3Y1sjYQUHtefMHpccZBA0aOwn9FoX8rW.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":101,"name":"Studio 4°C","slug":"studio_4c"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":12126,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12113,"title":{"romaji":"HALLOWEEN PARTY -Poupelle Ver.-","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":14145,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":16560,"basename":"EntotsuMachiNoPoupelle-OP1.webm","filename":"EntotsuMachiNoPoupelle-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/EntotsuMachiNoPoupelle-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":64863864,"resolution":816,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"OVER","source":"BD","tags":"NCBD816","audio"